  _pages:
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 35af1f0b1d8b13f4da2abba1ed5eff28, type: 3}
    Title: Firearm
    Body: 'Press {Q} to draw or holster your gun.

      Hold {RMB} to aim and press {LMB} to shoot.

      Normal shots deal no damage, but they stun ghosts for a moment.'
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7bae6ea8dcbb0de4592bc10473508c99, type: 3}
    Title: Firearm
    Body: 'Keep an eye on the SP bar at the top left of the screen.

      When it is full, your next shot is empowered and can destroy a ghost in one hit.'
